diff --git a/README.en.md b/README.en.md
index 2ff6b2b..7f94f6a 100644
--- a/README.en.md
+++ b/README.en.md
@@ -54,6 +54,8 @@ from hyper_multicore import MegaMoeExperts, MegaGate, MegaMhc
 from hyper_multicore.diagnostics import MegaKernelDiagnostics
 ```
 
+`MegaMoeExperts` selects its backend with `precision="bf16"` (default) or `precision="mxfp8"`.
+MXFP8 requires A5 and caller-provided quantized weight storage.
 See the [component guide](hyper_multicore/README.md) for configuration and usage.
 Activate native paths before starting a Python process that uses the operators.
 pip and Python imports do not compile native code.
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 270a553..9f39dcc 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@ from hyper_multicore import MegaMoeExperts, MegaGate, MegaMhc
 from hyper_multicore.diagnostics import MegaKernelDiagnostics
 ```
 
+`MegaMoeExperts` 通过 `precision="bf16"`（默认）或 `precision="mxfp8"` 选择后端；MXFP8 要求 A5 和调用方提供量化权重存储。
 配置与使用方式见[组件指南](hyper_multicore/README.md)。使用算子的 Python 进程启动前，
 需先激活 native 路径。pip 安装及 Python 导入均不会编译 native 代码。
 
